[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0079","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0079.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1371","title":"CUPS image-gif 零长度GIF图像处理远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Common Unix Printing System (CUPS) 1.1.14 至 1.1.17 版本中 filters/image-gif.c 组件存在零长度 GIF 图像检查缺失漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 GIF 图像块头（chunk headers）触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响运行 CUPS 1.1.14-1.1.17 的各类 Unix/Linux 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已发布补丁修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1371"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:11Z","remediation":"立即将 CUPS 升级至 1.1.18 或更高版本。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新：Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2002:295 提供的 cups-1.1.14-15 或更新版本；Debian 用户安装 DSA-232 提供的 cupsys 更新包；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:001 更新。如无法升级，可在 CUPS 配置文件 /etc/cups/cupsd.conf 中禁用远程打印访问（将 Listen localhost:631 取消注释并注释掉 Port 631），或通过防火墙限制 631 端口的入站流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0117.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000702","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104032149026670&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-232","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/12.19.02.txt","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:001","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_002_cups.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6439","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10911","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-1371.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1371.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1371.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1371.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f04