ry/12.19.02.txt","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:001","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_002_cups.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6438","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10910","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-1369.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a4cc8a55779a13aab23d5f0d0cd6e52496b071eb/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1369.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1369.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1369.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1369","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1369.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1369.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1369.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6c0593e61f0f414ea233c11da6523481203bd9cf/2002/CVE-2002-1369.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1369.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0078.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0077","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1368","title":"CUPS HTTP 请求缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Common Unix Printing System（CUPS）1.1.14 至 1.1.17 版本存在负值长度 HTTP 头处理漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在 Content-Length 头或 chunked transfer encoding 中注入负值长度参数，这些负值被传入 memcpy() 内存复制函数后，可导致缓冲区溢出，从而引发拒绝服务（程序崩溃）并可能被利用执行任意代码。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，攻击复杂度低，影响使用受影响版本 CUPS 的 Unix/Linux 系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1368"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-12-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:11Z","remediation":"将 CUPS 升级至 1.1.18 或更高版本，新版本已修复 HTTP 请求头中负数 Content-Length 及 chunked transfer encoding 长度参数未做校验导致 memcpy() 被传入负值的问题。如暂无法升级，可通过 iptables 限制远程对 631 端口的 HTTP 访问，仅允许本地回环地址访问打印服务，或配置 cupsd.conf 中的 Port 指令仅监听 127.0.0.1:631 以临时缓解远程攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0117.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000702","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104032149026670&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/7756/","http://secunia.com/advisories/7794","http://secunia.com/advisories/7803","http://secunia.com/advisories/7843","http://secunia.com/advisories/7858","http://secunia.com/advisories/7907","http://secunia.com/advisories/7913/","http://secunia.com/advisories/8080/","http://secunia.com/advisories/9325/","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-232","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/12.19.02.txt","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:001","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_002_cups.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6437","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10909","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22106","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1368.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1368.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/52138c35bcb0784b4efb0e41fb1e599736d809a9/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1368.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1368.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1368","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1368.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1368.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1368.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/343a9c8af3f97395548d45562cf85cc26422f7cd/2002/CVE-2002-1368.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1368.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0077.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0077.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0076","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0076.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1367","title":"CUPS 远程未授权添加打印机漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Common Unix Printing System（CUPS）1.1.14 至 1.1.17 版本存在认证绕过漏洞，攻击者无需任何身份验证即可通过发送特制的 UDP 数据包向目标系统添加打印机。该漏洞利用 CUPS 在处理打印机添加请求时未正确校验权限的缺陷，攻击者可借此执行未授权操作，例如通过管理界面的\"需要授权\"页面窃取本地 root 证书，从而获取管理权限并进一步控制受影响的 Unix/Linux 系统。该漏洞影响 CUPS 1.1.14、1.1.15、1.1.16 和 1.1.17 所有版本，CVSS 评分 10，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1367"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:11Z","remediation":"建议将 CUPS 升级至 1.1.18 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，可通过防火墙策略拦截进入 631 端口的 UDP 流量，或在配置文件中限制 CUPS 仅监听本地回环地址，以阻断远程未授权添加打印机的攻击路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0117.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000702","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104032149026670&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-232","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/12.19.02.txt","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:001","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_002_cups.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6436","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10908","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-1367.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/38590de6b24a9e23ae9a8ab63556f3ebbcbcf955/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1367.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1367.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1367.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1367","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/908f27ce56b05b89bd69be9a1ba710270fd64008/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1367.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1367.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1367.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7ca72f8b280c50be359cf5a3469c32f4f075a09e/2002/CVE-2002-1367.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1367.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0076.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0075","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0075.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1366","title":"Apple CUPS 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Common Unix Printing System (CUPS) 1.1.14 至 1.1.17 版本存在文件竞争条件漏洞。具有 lp 权限的本地攻击者可通过在打印作业处理过程中与其他进程竞争文件操作，利用时间差创建或覆盖系统任意文件。该漏洞影响 macOS X 及部分 Unix/Linux 系统上的 CUPS 打印服务，攻击者可借此获取对关键系统文件的写权限，进而导致权限提升或系统被控。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1366"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:11Z","remediation":"升级 CUPS 至 1.1.18 或更高版本以修复文件竞争条件漏洞。Debian 系统执行 apt-get upgrade cupsys 应用 DSA-232 补丁，Red Hat 系统应用 RHSA-2002:295 更新包，Mandrake 系统应用 MDKSA-2003:001 补丁。如无法立即升级，应临时撤销不必要的 lp 用户账户权限，仅允许可信用户访问打印服务，并将 /var/spool/cups 等目录权限收紧为 cups 用户独占可写，阻止本地用户创建或覆盖任意文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0117.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104032149026670&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-232","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/12.19.02.txt","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:001","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_002_cups.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6435","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10907","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-1366.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/14587a553af4d49d5605e1beebb7fda4e5c12c66/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1366.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1366.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1366.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1366","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f8f41b3c8a1114b748f2f7bb00dbfa68417789/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1366.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1366.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1366.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1366.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/06f2f9a47baa9a6d26014b1cc43fd2ec49d23a26/2002/CVE-2002-1366.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0075.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0075.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0075.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0572","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0572.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1351","title":"Melange Chat Server 1.10 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Melange Chat System 1.10 在 chat_InterpretData 函数中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送超长昵称（Nick）请求触发该漏洞，导致聊天服务器崩溃或执行任意代码。该漏洞源于 msgText 缓冲区未对输入长度进行充分校验，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，利用条件简单。受影响的 Melange Chat Server 1.10 版本极易遭受拒绝服务攻击，在特定条件下也可能导致远程代码执行。建议升级至官方修复版本或关闭不必要的聊天服务端口以降低风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1351"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-12-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:09Z","remediation":"由于 Melange Chat Server 1.10 官方已停止维护且未发布补丁，建议立即将该聊天服务替换为仍在持续更新的替代产品（如 Mattermost、Rocket.Chat 或 Zulip）。如短期内无法完成替换，应在防火墙上严格限制 6666 端口的访问来源，仅允许可信内部 IP 段连接，并在不必要时完全关闭该服务以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://securitytracker.com/id?1005831","http://www.idefense.com/application/poi/display?id=33&type=vulnerabilities&flashstatus=false","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6477","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10939","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/382","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d8e64276ccc0390c8b8282c06f13ee665a5b9592/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1351.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1351.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1351","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1351.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1351.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/881dc8aad9cc7f4353e5388bbdaaeb83a2e3abe3/2002/CVE-2002-1351.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1351.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1351.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1351.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1351.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0572.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0575","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0575.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1364","title":"traceroute-nanog 6 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"traceroute-nanog 6.0 至 6.1.1 版本的 get_origin() 函数存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。该函数位于 traceroute.c 中，负责解析 WHOIS 响应的域名信息，但在解析过程中未对缓冲区长度进行 adequate 边界检查。攻击者可通过设置 RA_SERVER 和 RA_SERVICE 环境变量，将 traceroute 的 WHOIS 查询重定向至攻击者控制的恶意 DNS 服务器。该服务器返回特制构造的超长 WHOIS 响应数据，在 get_origin() 函数中使用 strncpy() 复制到 100 字节的 tmp4[] 缓冲区时触发溢出，进而覆盖栈上的 EBP 与返回地址。通过精心构造的 off-by-two 攻击技术，攻击者可将执行流程重定向至存储在环境变量中的 Shellcode，最终在本地获得 root 权限。该漏洞在 SuSE Linux 7.x 及 8.0 等系统上已被验证可被利用，CVSS 评分为 7.2。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1364"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:10Z","remediation":"升级到 traceroute-nanog 6.1.1-1.3 或更高版本（如 6.3.10-2），该版本在 get_origin() 函数中增加了对 WHOIS 响应数据的边界检查，修复了 strcpy 无边界复制导致的栈溢出问题。Debian 用户可通过 apt-get upgrade 安装 DSA-254 安全更新，SuSE/Novell 用户应安装对应厂商发布的 2002_043 安全补丁。如系统自带标准 traceroute 或 tracepath 工具，建议直接停用 traceroute-nanog 并切换至系统原生工具以彻底消除风险。临时缓解措施：卸载 traceroute-nanog 或设置其二进制文件权限为 000 禁止执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103858895600963&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-254","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_043_traceroute_nanog_nkitb.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6166","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10778","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22014","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1364.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/52138c35bcb0784b4efb0e41fb1e599736d809a9/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1364.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1364.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1364.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1364.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1364","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1364.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1364.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1364.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1364.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0575.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0574","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0574.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1361","title":"Sun Cobalt RaQ 4 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sun Cobalt RaQ 4 应用服务器在安装安全加固补丁（SHP）后，其管理界面的 overflow.cgi CGI 脚本存在命令注入漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该脚本发送包含 shell 元字符的 POST 请求，利用 email 参数执行任意系统命令，从而完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响安装 SHP 补丁的 Sun Cobalt RaQ 4 设备，攻击者无需凭据即可在远程服务器上执行任意代码，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1361"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:10Z","remediation":"Sun Microsystems 已发布 RaQ4-en-Security-2.0.1-SHP_REM.pkg 补丁包，用于彻底移除存在漏洞的 SHP（Security Hardening Patch）组件，建议立即从 ftp.cobalt.sun.com/pub/packages/raq4/eng/ 下载并安装该补丁。若无法立即安装补丁，可通过防火墙阻断对管理端口 81（非 SSL）和 444（SSL）的远程访问作为临时缓解措施，同时禁用或删除 overflow.cgi 脚本（路径 /cgi-bin/.cobalt/overflow/overflow.cgi），以防止未经授权的远程代码执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103912513522807&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doc=fsalert/49377","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-35.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-025.shtml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/810921","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6326","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10776","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22072","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1361.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1361","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1361.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1361.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1361.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1361.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1361.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1361.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/15dc4562a27a859de217929d811811b842ebac90/2002/CVE-2002-1361.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2002-1361.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0574.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0573","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0573.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1359","title":"PuTTY SSH2客户端 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"PuTTY 0.53 等 SSH2 客户端及服务器在处理超大尺寸的数据包或字段时存在输入验证不足漏洞（CWE-20），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 SSH 服务发送特制的畸形数据包触发缓冲区溢出，进而导致目标系统崩溃（拒绝服务）或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用 PuTTY 0.53 版本及存在类似 SSH 协议解析缺陷的其他 SSH2 客户端/服务器，攻击者无需任何凭据即可在建立 SSH 连接后利用，危害极大。CVSS 评分 10.0，严重等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1359"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:10Z","remediation":"tags. Let me make sure my answer is clean and follows the format.\n\nWait, I should also check if the current TOML structure has any issues I need to be aware of. Looking at the current TOML, the remediation field is malformed with triple quotes and backticks inside. I just need to provide the replacement value.\n\nLet me finalize the remediation text. I want it to be accurate, specific, and actionable.基于 PuTTY 变更日志，0.53b（2002-11-12 发布）已修复 Rapid7 SSHredder 测试套件发现的此漏洞（CERT 公告 CA-2002-36）。\n\n<value>升级 PuTTY 到 0.53b 或更高版本，PuTTY 已在 0.53b 中修复由 Rapid7 SSHredder 测试套件发现的 SSH2 数据包处理缓冲区溢出漏洞（CERT 公告 CA-2002-36）。对于其他受影响的 SSH2 客户端或服务器，应联系厂商获取安全补丁。如无法立即升级，应避免连接不受信任的 SSH 服务器，并通过防火墙限制 SSH 服务的出站连接，同时启用 SSH 协议版本 2 的严格模式以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0110.html","http://securitytracker.com/id?1005812","http://securitytracker.com/id?1005813","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-36.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6407","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10870","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A5848","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/1788","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1359.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2002/CVE-2002-1359.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1359.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1359.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1359.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1359","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1359.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/4709d2cbd3a3d8c1f80eac233d785d5a127e7498/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-1359.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1359.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1359.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0573.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0373","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0373.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1380","title":"Linux Kernel 2.2 mmap() 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.2.x 存在本地拒绝服务漏洞，其 mmap() 系统调用在处理 /proc/pid/mem 接口时缺少充分的内存页访问权限检查。本地低权限用户可利用 mmap() 函数以 PROT_READ 参数，通过 /proc/pid/mem 伪文件系统映射目标进程的非可读内存页，触发内核错误导致系统崩溃。该漏洞影响运行 Linux 内核 2.2.x 系列的系统，攻击者需先在目标主机上拥有本地登录权限，再利用 ptrace() 附加到自身进程后打开 /proc/self/mem，通过 mmap() 映射不可读的内存区域即可触发内核崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该问题不影响 2.4 内核版本，因为 2.4 内核中已移除了对 /proc/pid/mem 接口的 mmap() 支持。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1380"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:13Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.20-5 或更高版本（Debian woody 可通过 apt-get upgrade linux-image-2.2.20-i386 安装 2.2.20-5 修复版本），或迁移至受官方支持的 2.4/2.6 及以上内核。如无法立即升级，可临时通过 sysctl 设置 vm.mmap_min_addr = 65536 限制 mmap() 对低地址内存的映射，并在 /etc/fstab 中对 /proc 挂载选项添加 noexec,nosuid,nodev 以限制本地用户对 /proc/pid/mem 的访问，同时审查本地用户权限避免未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-336","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/engarde_advisory-2976.html","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:039","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-088.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6420","http://www.trustix.net/errata/misc/2002/TSL-2002-0083-kernel.asc.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10884","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22105","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1380.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c77fff35609ce3594a3cffb2b3b0994cbb03c5f2/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1380.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1380","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1380.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ed0864e87bec515a12f89ab060c3cbb0a6a56af5/2002/CVE-2002-1380.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1380.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1380.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1380.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/6bb18b34820034d354785c1f34bbb7285e8899e0/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1380.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1380.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0373.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0373.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0373.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0367","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0367.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1376","title":"MySQL libmysqlclient 客户端库拒绝服务与远程代码执行漏洞","description":"MySQL 3.x 至 3.23.54 及 4.x 至 4.0.6 版本的 libmysqlclient 客户端库中的 read_rows 和 read_one_row 函数未正确验证特定响应中的长度字段，存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 MySQL 服务器发送特制的恶意响应数据包触发该漏洞，导致服务拒绝响应，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1376"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:12Z","remediation":"升级 MySQL 至 3.23.55 及以上版本（3.x 分支）或 4.0.7 及以上版本（4.x 分支），该漏洞在 libmysqlclient 的 read_rows/read_one_row 函数中修复了长度字段校验问题。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界限制对 MySQL 端口的访问（默认 3306 端口），仅允许可信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000555","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103971644013961&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104004857201968&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104005886114500&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104033188706000&w=2","http://security.e-matters.de/advisories/042002.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-212","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/engarde_advisory-2660.html","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:087","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-288.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6370","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6374","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10849","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10