，仅允许可信来源连接，并避免使用具有高权限的数据库账户。Linux 发行版用户可安装对应安全更新，如 Red Hat RHSA-2002:288、Debian DSA-212 及 Mandrake MDKSA-2002:087 提供的补丁包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000555","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103971644013961&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104004857201968&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104005886114500&w=2","http://security.e-matters.de/advisories/042002.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-212","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/engarde_advisory-2660.html","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:087","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_003_mysql.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-288.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-289.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-166.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/5269","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6375","http://www.trustix.net/errata/misc/2002/TSL-2002-0086-mysql.asc.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10848","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22085","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1375.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2002/CVE-2002-1375.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1375.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/71e7ec7831487791fa2712228e5e13057adec23c/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1375.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1375.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1375","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-1375.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1375.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1375.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1375.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0365.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0364","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0364.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1374","title":"MySQL COM_CHANGE_USER 密码长度认证绕过漏洞","description":"MySQL 数据库 COM_CHANGE_USER 命令存在密码验证绕过漏洞。由于服务器仅将攻击者提供的密码与实际密码的首字符进行比对，而非完整比较整个密码字符串，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过暴力破解手段快速猜中密码首字符，进而逐步获得数据库访问权限并提升权限。该漏洞影响 MySQL 3.x 3.23.54 之前版本及 4.x 4.0.6 之前版本，攻击者向目标发送特制的 COM_CHANGE_USER 命令即可发起利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1374"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:12Z","remediation":"立即将 MySQL 服务器升级至 3.23.54 或更高版本（3.x 系列）以及 4.0.6 或更高版本（4.x 系列），以修复 COM_CHANGE_USER 命令仅比较密码第一个字符的漏洞。在无法立即升级时，应在 MySQL 配置中启用 `validate_password_policy=MEDIUM` 强制所有用户使用至少 8 字符的复杂密码，并在防火墙或访问控制列表中限制对 3306 端口的远程访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000555","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103971644013961&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104004857201968&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104005886114500&w=2","http://security.e-matters.de/advisories/042002.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-212","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/engarde_advisory-2660.html","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:087","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_003_mysql.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-288.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-289.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-166.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/5269","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6373","http://www.trustix.net/errata/misc/2002/TSL-2002-0086-mysql.asc.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10847","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22084","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1374.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2002/CVE-2002-1374.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1374.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/71e7ec7831487791fa2712228e5e13057adec23c/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1374.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1374.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1374","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1374.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1374.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1374.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/25203fd38febf163b5a0afeecde6a3effc609cec/2002/CVE-2002-1374.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0364.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0362","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0362.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1373","title":"MySQL COM_TABLE_DUMP 有符号整数溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"MySQL 3.23.53 及之前版本的 COM_TABLE_DUMP 数据包处理中存在有符号整数漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 mysqld 服务发送特制请求，传入大负数整数触发 memcpy 调用时的符号整数溢出，导致服务崩溃或挂起，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 MySQL 3.23.x 系列所有低于 3.23.54 的版本，攻击无需身份认证，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1373"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:12Z","remediation":"升级 MySQL 至 3.23.54 或更高版本，该版本修复了 COM_TABLE_DUMP 包中有符号整数溢出导致的拒绝服务漏洞。各发行版用户可参考 Debian DSA-212、RedHat RHSA-2002-288/289 或 Mandrake MDKSA-2002:087 等安全公告安装对应补丁。如无法立即升级，可在网络层通过 iptables 限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 MySQL 3306 端口作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000555","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103971644013961&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104004857201968&w=2","http://security.e-matters.de/advisories/042002.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-212","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:087","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_003_mysql.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-288.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-289.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-166.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/5269","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6368","http://www.trustix.net/errata/misc/2002/TSL-2002-0086-mysql.asc.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10846","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-1373.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1373.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1373.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1373.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1373","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1373.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1373.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1373.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/963f7056505b7264e8baa3ce879232850f792056/2002/CVE-2002-1373.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1373.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0362.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0355","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0355.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1362","title":"Matthew Smith mICQ 0.4.9 及更早版本中存在拒绝服务漏洞","description":"mICQ 是一款开源的 ICQ 即时通讯客户端软件。该漏洞存在于 mICQ 0.4.9 及更早版本中，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送缺少 0xFE 分隔符字符的畸形 ICQ 消息类型触发拒绝服务。漏洞原理在于 mICQ 在解析 ICQ 消息时未正确处理缺少 0xFE 分隔符的消息类型，导致程序异常终止。该漏洞可通过网络远程利用，无需身份认证，仅影响系统可用性（机密性与完整性不受影响），CVSS 评分为 5.0。利用条件简单：攻击者只需向使用受影响版本 mICQ 客户端的用户发送特制的畸形 ICQ 消息即可，触发后客户端将崩溃退出，无法继续接收和处理 ICQ 消息，从而造成服务中断，影响普通用户及企业内部通信效率。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1362"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:10Z","remediation":"建议将 mICQ 升级至 0.4.9.4 或更高版本以修复该拒绝服务漏洞。Debian Woody 用户应安装 DSA-211 安全更新（micq 0.4.9-0woody3），Unstable 用户升级至 0.4.9.4-1。如暂时无法升级，可在防火墙上限制 ICQ 协议入站连接，或临时禁用自动接收陌生 ICQ 消息作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-211","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-118.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6392","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10872","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1362.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1362","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d6db6ddfb07ef853c79bb625eb614ba3cefe7aaf/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1362.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402a